---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Sankalp for Ayurvedic Doctors — Make Your Protocols Follow Your Sadhaks Home"
  description="Your diagnosis is right. The follow-through is where it breaks. Sankalp carries your Ayurvedic protocol into your Sadhak's daily life — so the healing you prescribe actually happens."
  path="/for-doctors.html"
  active="for-doctors"
>

<div class="scroll-bar" id="scrollBar"></div>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="fd-hero" id="hero">
  <div class="fd-hero-fx" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="fd-hero-inner">
    <div class="kicker c">For Ayurvedic Doctors</div>
    <h1 class="h1">Your treatment is right.<br><em>The follow-through is where it breaks.</em></h1>
    <p class="lead c">You read the root. You prescribe the path &mdash; ahara, herbs, dinacharya, breath. Then your Sadhak walks out, and daily life quietly undoes it all. Sankalp carries your protocol into their everyday &mdash; so the healing you prescribe actually happens.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="#problem" class="btn btn-primary">See the problem &rarr;</a>
      <a href="#partner" class="btn btn-ghost">Partner with us</a>
    </div>

    <!-- the gap, visualised -->
    <div class="gapstrip reveal">
      <div class="gap-end">
        <div class="gap-num">1 hour</div>
        <div class="gap-lbl">With you</div>
      </div>
      <div class="gap-mid"><span>~700 hours alone &mdash; where the healing is lost</span></div>
      <div class="gap-end">
        <div class="gap-num">Next visit</div>
        <div class="gap-lbl">A month later</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROBLEM -->
<section class="fd-section problem" id="problem">
  <div class="wrap narrow center">
    <div class="kicker c">The Problem</div>
    <h2 class="h2">The gap isn't in your prescription.<br><em>It's in the days you never see.</em></h2>
    <p class="lead c">A Sadhak spends one hour with you, then lives a thousand alone before the next visit. That is where the protocol is forgotten, the old habits return, and the slow, steady medicine of Ayurveda never gets the consistency it needs to work.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="chain">
      <div class="chain-step reveal">
        <div class="chain-dot"><div class="chain-num">1</div><div class="chain-line"></div></div>
        <div><h4>You prescribe the right protocol</h4><p>Constitution read, imbalance named, the exact path to balance handed over.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chain-step reveal">
        <div class="chain-dot"><div class="chain-num">2</div><div class="chain-line"></div></div>
        <div><h4>By day three, the details blur</h4><p>&ldquo;Was it warm water or cold? Before food or after? Which breath, how long?&rdquo;</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chain-step reveal">
        <div class="chain-dot"><div class="chain-num">3</div><div class="chain-line"></div></div>
        <div><h4>Old habits quietly return</h4><p>Late nights, cold meals, the phone in bed. The body slips back into stress mode.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chain-step reveal">
        <div class="chain-dot"><div class="chain-num">4</div><div class="chain-line"></div></div>
        <div><h4>They return no better</h4><p>The protocol was never truly followed &mdash; so the change never had a chance to arrive.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chain-step fail reveal">
        <div class="chain-dot"><div class="chain-num">5</div><div class="chain-line"></div></div>
        <div><h4>&ldquo;Ayurveda didn't work for me&rdquo;</h4><p>And one more person quietly drifts toward a pill that only silences the symptom.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="punch reveal">The medicine was never wrong.<br>It simply never got followed.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SOLUTION -->
<section class="fd-section" id="solution">
  <div class="wrap narrow center">
    <div class="kicker c">The Solution</div>
    <h2 class="h2">Sankalp lives where your Sadhak lives &mdash; <em>every single day.</em></h2>
    <p class="lead c">Not another clinic tool to learn. A daily companion that carries your exact protocol into their hands, reminds them, explains the <em>why</em> in the language of modern science, and shows you who is truly following through.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal" data-d="1">
        <div class="step-n">STEP 01</div>
        <span class="step-ico">&#129658;</span>
        <h4>You prescribe</h4>
        <p>Your protocol &mdash; food, herbs, dinacharya, pranayama &mdash; becomes their personal plan. For now, you simply tell us; we set it up.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal" data-d="2">
        <div class="step-n">STEP 02</div>
        <span class="step-ico">&#127765;</span>
        <h4>It becomes their day</h4>
        <p>Each morning, one clear, simple practice. No five-page sheet to decipher &mdash; just the next right step.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal" data-d="3">
        <div class="step-n">STEP 03</div>
        <span class="step-ico">&#10024;</span>
        <h4>They understand, so they follow</h4>
        <p>Every step explained through modern science &mdash; the <em>why</em> that turns an instruction into belief, and belief into a habit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal" data-d="4">
        <div class="step-n">STEP 04</div>
        <span class="step-ico">&#128065;</span>
        <h4>You see the truth</h4>
        <p>A simple view of who is actually following through, between visits &mdash; so you guide with clarity, not guesswork.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FOR THE SADHAK -->
<section class="fd-section" id="sadhak">
  <div class="wrap narrow center">
    <div class="kicker c">What changes for your Sadhak</div>
    <h2 class="h2">From a forgotten prescription <em>to a daily ritual.</em></h2>
    <p class="lead c">Sadhak <span class="dev sanskrit-inline">(&#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2325;)</span> &mdash; not a patient waiting to be fixed, but a person walking their own path of healing. Sankalp walks it with them, day by day.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ba">
      <div class="ba-col before reveal">
        <span class="ba-tag">Without Sankalp</span>
        <ul>
          <li>A prescription sheet folded in a drawer</li>
          <li>&ldquo;What did the doctor say about water?&rdquo;</li>
          <li>Motivation fades by the first week</li>
          <li>No sense of whether anything is changing</li>
          <li>Returns unsure, a little discouraged</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="ba-col after reveal" data-d="1">
        <span class="ba-tag">With Sankalp</span>
        <ul>
          <li>A clear, gentle practice every morning</li>
          <li>Understands <em>why</em> each step heals</li>
          <li>Feels progress &mdash; streaks, symptoms easing</li>
          <li>Watches their imbalance move back toward balance</li>
          <li>Stays connected to you between visits</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FOR YOU -->
<section class="fd-section" id="you">
  <div class="wrap narrow center">
    <div class="kicker c">Why this serves your practice</div>
    <h2 class="h2">Better outcomes &mdash; <em>without more of your hours.</em></h2>
    <p class="lead c">Sankalp never diagnoses and never replaces you. It carries out <em>your</em> plan, faithfully, in the one place you cannot be: their daily life.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="bgrid">
      <div class="bcard reveal" data-d="1"><span class="ico">&#127793;</span><h4>Outcomes that hold</h4><p>Adherence is the whole difference between a protocol that heals and one that's abandoned. We protect the follow-through.</p></div>
      <div class="bcard reveal" data-d="2"><span class="ico">&#128173;</span><h4>Stop repeating yourself</h4><p>The app explains the why and sends the reminders &mdash; so you don't spend each visit re-teaching the basics.</p></div>
      <div class="bcard reveal" data-d="3"><span class="ico">&#128202;</span><h4>See between visits</h4><p>Know who is following through before they walk back in. Guide with real signal, not memory.</p></div>
      <div class="bcard reveal" data-d="1"><span class="ico">&#128300;</span><h4>Ayurveda, made credible</h4><p>Every ancient instruction is paired with the modern science behind it &mdash; the proof today's Sadhaks need to trust the path.</p></div>
      <div class="bcard reveal" data-d="2"><span class="ico">&#127757;</span><h4>Your reach, extended</h4><p>Your wisdom guiding people far beyond clinic hours &mdash; without thinning the care each one receives.</p></div>
      <div class="bcard reveal" data-d="3"><span class="ico">&#128081;</span><h4>You remain the healer</h4><p>No algorithm overrides you. Sankalp is your hands between visits &mdash; never a replacement for them.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="fd-section fd-cta" id="partner">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-card reveal">
      <div class="kicker c light">A quiet beginning</div>
      <h2 class="h2 light">Start with a few of your Sadhaks.</h2>
      <p class="lead c light">No software to learn, no setup on your side. Share one link with a handful of your Sadhaks &mdash; and watch your protocols finally follow them home.</p>
      <div class="rule c"></div>
      <a href="mailto:hello@sankalphealth.in?subject=Partnering%20with%20Sankalp" class="btn btn-primary btn-onlight">Partner with us &rarr;</a>
      <p class="soft">We'll walk you through it personally &mdash; no commitment to begin.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</PageLayout>

<style>
  .wrap { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
  .narrow { max-width: 720px; }
  .center { text-align: center; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

  .fd-section { padding: clamp(64px, 9vw, 104px) 0; }
  .fd-section:nth-of-type(even) { background: var(--bg-soft); }

  .kicker {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--green);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .kicker.c { justify-content: center; }
  .kicker::before, .kicker.c::after { content: ''; width: 24px; height: 1px; background: var(--green); opacity: .45; }
  .kicker.light { color: rgba(255,255,255,.85); }
  .kicker.light::before, .kicker.light::after { background: rgba(255,255,255,.5); }

  .h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 58px); letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.16; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .h1 em, .h2 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--green); }
  .h2 { font-size: clamp(26px, 3.8vw, 40px); line-height: 1.22; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .h2.light { color: #fff; }
  .h2.light em { color: var(--gold-soft); }

  .lead { font-size: clamp(16.5px, 1.9vw, 19px); color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; max-width: 640px; }
  .lead.c { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .lead.light { color: rgba(255,255,255,.82); }

  .rule { width: 44px; height: 2px; background: var(--gold); border-radius: 2px; margin: 24px 0; }
  .rule.c { margin: 24px auto; }

  .sanskrit-inline { color: var(--gold); }

  /* HERO */
  .fd-hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 110px 24px 80px;
    text-align: center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 90% at 100% -10%, rgba(217,184,119,.14), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(100% 80% at -8% 108%, rgba(21,122,91,.10), transparent 58%),
      linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff 0%,#fbfdfc 60%,#f4f7f5 100%);
  }
  .fd-hero-fx {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(21,122,91,.06) 1px, transparent 1.5px);
    background-size: 26px 26px;
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(120% 100% at 50% 0%, #000 30%, transparent 76%);
    mask-image: radial-gradient(120% 100% at 50% 0%, #000 30%, transparent 76%);
  }
  .fd-hero-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 8px; }

  .gapstrip {
    margin: 50px auto 0; max-width: 640px;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 18px;
  }
  .gap-end { text-align: center; }
  .gap-num { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; color: var(--ink); font-size: clamp(19px, 3vw, 26px); font-weight: 600; }
  .gap-lbl { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--green); margin-top: 6px; }
  .gap-mid { position: relative; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--line), var(--accent), var(--line)); }
  .gap-mid span {
    position: absolute; top: -26px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    white-space: nowrap; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); font-size: 14.5px;
  }

  /* PROBLEM CHAIN */
  .chain { max-width: 720px; margin: 44px auto 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .chain-step { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 22px; padding: 18px 0; }
  .chain-dot { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .chain-num {
    width: 40px; height: 40px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; color: var(--green); font-size: 15px; background: var(--green-soft);
  }
  .chain-line { width: 1px; flex: 1; background: var(--line); margin-top: 8px; min-height: 22px; }
  .chain-step:last-child .chain-line { display: none; }
  .chain-step h4 { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .chain-step p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); }
  .chain-step.fail .chain-num { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .chain-step.fail h4 { color: var(--accent); }
  .punch { text-align: center; margin-top: 44px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(19px, 2.8vw, 25px); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.5; }

  /* SOLUTION STEPS */
  .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 48px; }
  .step {
    background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 28px 22px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); transition: transform .3s var(--ease), box-shadow .3s;
  }
  .step:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
  .step-n { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: var(--green); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .step-ico { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; display: block; }
  .step h4 { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .step p { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* BEFORE / AFTER */
  .ba { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; margin-top: 48px; }
  .ba-col { border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 30px 28px; }
  .ba-col.before { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .ba-col.after { background: var(--green-soft); border: 1px solid #bfe3d3; }
  .ba-tag { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 20px; display: inline-block; }
  .ba-col.before .ba-tag { color: var(--muted); }
  .ba-col.after .ba-tag { color: var(--green); }
  .ba-col ul { list-style: none; }
  .ba-col li { font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px 0 12px 30px; position: relative; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .ba-col li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .ba-col.before li { color: var(--muted); }
  .ba-col.before li::before { content: '\2715'; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .ba-col.after li { color: var(--text); }
  .ba-col.after li::before { content: '\2713'; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 12px; color: var(--green); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }

  /* BENEFITS */
  .bgrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 48px; }
  .bcard {
    background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 30px 26px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); transition: transform .3s var(--ease), box-shadow .3s;
  }
  .bcard:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
  .bcard .ico { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 14px; display: block; }
  .bcard h4 { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .bcard p { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* CTA */
  .fd-cta { text-align: center; }
  .cta-card {
    max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 24px; padding: clamp(44px, 7vw, 72px) 32px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), var(--green-dark)); color: #fff;
  }
  .cta-card .btn-onlight { background: #fff; color: var(--green-dark); box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.18); }
  .cta-card .btn-onlight:hover { background: var(--green-soft); }
  .cta-card .soft { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); font-size: 14.5px; margin-top: 20px; }

  /* REVEAL ON SCROLL */
  .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(26px); transition: opacity .8s var(--ease), transform .8s var(--ease); }
  .reveal.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .reveal[data-d="1"] { transition-delay: .08s; }
  .reveal[data-d="2"] { transition-delay: .16s; }
  .reveal[data-d="3"] { transition-delay: .24s; }
  .reveal[data-d="4"] { transition-delay: .32s; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; } }

  /* SCROLL PROGRESS BAR */
  .scroll-bar { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; height: 2px; width: 0; z-index: 300; background: var(--green); }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
    .bgrid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .ba { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .bgrid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .gapstrip { gap: 12px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .gapstrip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; max-width: 280px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .gap-mid { height: auto; background: none; display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 4px 0; }
    .gap-mid span { position: static; transform: none; white-space: normal; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; max-width: 250px; margin: 0 auto; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  (function () {
    var bar = document.getElementById('scrollBar');
    function onScroll() {
      var y = window.scrollY;
      var h = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;
      if (bar) bar.style.width = (h > 0 ? (y / h * 100) : 0) + '%';
    }
    window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });
    onScroll();

    var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
      entries.forEach(function (en) {
        if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); }
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.14, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });
    document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(function (el) { io.observe(el); });
  })();
</script>
